text_01E6:
    string "Father.... ≦"                 ; ja: 父上・・・・≦

text_01F5:
    string "Ribbit?"                    ; ja: けろっけろ？

text_0202:
    string "What will happen now, myon ≦"  ; ja: これからどうなるのかみょん≦

text_021F:
    string "Fufufufufufufufufufu%KA store worthy of me, myon ♪"  ; ja: ふふふふふふふふふふ%K僕にふさわしいお店だみょん♪

text_0252:
    string "Ultimate and strongest! I won't%Klose anymore, myon ★"  ; ja: 究極最強！もう負けないみょん★

text_0271:
    string "With this I can win! I can win,%Kmyon ♪"  ; ja: これなら勝てる！勝てるみょん♪

text_0290:
    string "Merged! The strongest shop is%Kborn, myon ♪"  ; ja: 合体！最強ショップの誕生だみょん♪

text_02B3:
    string "It got bigger, myon ♪"        ; ja: 大きくなったみょん♪

text_02C8:
    string "Getting bigger still, myon ∵"     ; ja: もっと大きくなれだみょん∵

text_02E3:
    string "It's closed, myon%KI think I'll go for a dip, myon"  ; ja: 休業中だみょん%K水浴びに行くことにするみょん

text_0310:
    string "A day off today, myon ♪%KIt's nice once in a while, myon ∝"  ; ja: 今日はお休みみょん♪%Kたまにはいいもんだみょん∝

text_0341:
    string "Closed of all things...%Kwhat luck, myon ∴"  ; ja: クローズだなんて・・・%Kとっても運がいいんだみょん∴

text_0376:
    string "It's cheap, myon%KA real bargain, myon ☆"  ; ja: 安いんだみょん%Kとにかく得々なのみょん☆

text_039F:
    string "If it's cheap, tasty and good,%Knothing more to say, myon ★"  ; ja: 安くて、おいしくて、いいものなら%K言うことなしみょん★

text_03D6:
    string "I'll buy it while I can, myon ♪"  ; ja: 今のうちに買っとくみょん♪

text_03F1:
    string "My new castle, myon"          ; ja: 僕の新しい城だみょん

text_0406:
    string "My new castle, myon%KEveryone stop by, myon ♭"  ; ja: 僕の新しい城だみょん%Kみんな寄っていけだみょん♭

text_0437:
    string "My new castle, myon%KSure to be a huge success, myon ★"  ; ja: 僕の新しい城だみょん%K大繁盛間違いなしだみょん★

text_0468:
    string "It's okay not to ride it, myon ♪"  ; ja: 乗らなくても平気だみょん♪

text_0483:
    string "It's full, myon!%KThey wouldn't let me on, myon!"  ; ja: 満員だみょん！%K乗せてくれなかったみょん！

text_04AE:
    string "What shall I do, myon ≦"      ; ja: どうしようかみょん≦

text_04C3:
    string "The world is money, money, money,%Kmyon"  ; ja: 世の中、かね・カネ・金だみょん

text_04E2:
    string "I'm a regular customer now,%Kmyon ♪"  ; ja: もう、お得意様だみょん♪

text_04FB:
    string "However much I have, it's never%Kenough, myon ≦"  ; ja: いくらあっても足りないみょん≦

text_051A:
    string "What floor is this, myon?"    ; ja: ここって、何階だみょん？

text_0533:
    string "We've arrived, myon ♪"        ; ja: 着きましたみょん♪

text_0546:
    string "Warp complete! Myon ♪"        ; ja: ワープ完了！だみょん♪

text_055D:
    string "...I'll smash it, myon!"      ; ja: ・・・壊してやるみょん！

text_0576:
    string "Something's bothering me, myon"  ; ja: なんか気になるみょん

text_058B:
    string "Myomyomyo-on ★∴≧?!"           ; ja: みょみょみょーん★∴≧？！

text_05A6:
    string "This is a crazy good deal, myon ♭"  ; ja: これってムチャクチャ得だみょん♭

text_05C7:
    string "Did I gain a little, myon ♪"  ; ja: ちょっとだけ得したかみょん♪

text_05E4:
    string "Ribbit, myon ★"               ; ja: けろっけろっみょん★

text_05F9:
    string "A present for the unfortunate%Kcommon folk"  ; ja: 恵まれない庶民にプレゼント

text_0614:
    string "My head is pounding, myon..."  ; ja: 頭ガンガンだみょん・・・

text_062D:
    string "My drive is slowly fading, myon"  ; ja: 徐々にやる気が消えるみょん

text_0648:
    string "Was buying this%Kthe right choice, myon?"  ; ja: これって買って%K正解だったのかみょん？

text_066F:
    string "What use is this place, myon?"  ; ja: ここは何の役に立つかみょん？

text_068C:
    string "Sorry, myon. The world of%Kcompetition is tough, myon"  ; ja: ゴメンだみょん%K勝負の世界は厳しいものだみょん

text_06BB:
    string "I have to save a little, myon ≦"  ; ja: 少し節約しなきゃだみょん≦

text_06D6:
    string "Money is for spending, myon"  ; ja: お金は使うためにあるんだみょん

text_06F5:
    string "Is my money shrinking fast, myon?"  ; ja: お金がドンドン減っていくみょん？

text_0716:
    string "Hmm It took longer than planned,%Kmyon ≦"  ; ja: うーん%K予定より時間がかかったみょん≦

text_073D:
    string "The turning point, myon ♪"    ; ja: 折り返し地点だみょん♪

text_0754:
    string "The road to the throne is long and%Ksteep, myon"  ; ja: 王者への道は長くけわしいみょん

text_0773:
    string "I'll use this as capital and keep%Ktrying, myon ♪"  ; ja: これを元手にガンバってくみょん♪

text_0794:
    string "To think I have to let go of this%Kplace is a shame, myon"  ; ja: ここを手放すことになるとは%Kザンネンだみょん

text_07C1:
    string "It's a store I don't need, myon%KMake the most of it, myon"  ; ja: 僕には必要ないお店だみょん%Kせいぜい使ってくれだみょん

text_07F8:
    string "Can't I pay with a loan, myon?"  ; ja: ローンじゃだめかみょん？

text_0811:
    string "I want it but I have no money,%Kmyon ≦"  ; ja: ほしいけどお金がないみょん≦

text_082E:
    string "Being poor is sad, myon ≦"    ; ja: 貧乏って切ないみょん≦

text_0845:
    string "I don't need a place like this,%Kmyon"  ; ja: こんな所はいらないみょん

text_085E:
    string "Would buying it have been better,%Kmyon?"  ; ja: 買った方が良かったかみょん？

text_087B:
    string "I have my own ideas, myon ∵"  ; ja: 僕には僕の考えがあるみょん∵

text_0898:
    string "Ribbit Ribbit"                ; ja: ゲロゲロゲロ～∥

text_08A9:
    string "Ribbit?"                        ; ja: ケロ？

text_08B0:
    string "Ribbit"                        ; ja: けろん
    bytes 0x00    ; padding
